"model": "small.en",
"text": "Third track, making samples obey the laws. Four families. Hard. Build the law into the network, say a potential whose curl has no divergence, or project each sample while drawing it. Soft. A penalty in the loss, obeyed only approximately. On the distribution, constrain the crowd cloud, by its covariance, or by the equation a steady cloud obeys. And symmetry, an equivariant flow, gives a symmetric cloud.",
